t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Without a command from Kal'tsit, it zips towards the enemy, although a cluster of Originium rises from the ground, fully encasing the monster within."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["Kal'tsit! Watch out—"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"You really have surprised me, AMa-10."},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"You've broken free of my control at the price of severing your own gemini cycle system, even if this makes your life now utterly fragile."},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"However, do you really intend to kill me via this method?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"I knew from a long time ago your consciousness was already assimilated into the information within Originium."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_humanchange","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"cameraeffect","a":{"effect":"Grayscale","amount":0.8,"keep":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"image":"50_i16","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"cameraeffect","a":{"effect":"Grayscale","amount":0,"keep":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Under these circumstances, it is impossible to truly kill you."},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"But what Theresa and Theresis accomplished convinced me of something."},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Your control over Originium is not absolute, and there still exist some methods to limit your authority over it."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"I did meet the two you speak of, within the Originium."},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"Their efforts were indeed unexpected, and a pleasantly surprising struggle."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"But what of it? How are you so sure now that killing me here won't be a futile act?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#1$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"When Mon3tr attacked you, you chose to defend yourself."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"......"},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"How did you do it?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#11$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"I see you have noticed."},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Based on Theresa's research into Originium as well as the trap you set for Dr. {@nickname}, I added a few plans to your awakening room."},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"As long as you wake up here, your consciousness will be trapped in this body, unable to return to Originium's sea of information."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#3$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Perhaps you will eventually manage to break through this restriction, and regain control over Originium, but right now you are merely human."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#7$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Priestess","text":"To think you'd go this far to rebel against me—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Priestess, you are not Terra's creator. The life on this land has no obligation to bend to your will."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"...This is my revenge on you, and my final act of resistance."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You see the woman standing across from you reveal a hint of hesitation, but immediately after, Originium surrounds her."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":10,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":90,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_icecrystlncrse","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"...It's too late."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["Amiya! Help Kal'tsit!"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"effect","a":{"name":"AVG_amiya_attack_01","layer":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Player/p_skill/p_skill_chimera","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.8,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.8,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.